&lt;p&gt;Be the rock that supports the team building a new way of doing nails for every woman around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a high-energy, ultra-organized superstar ready to make a massive impact? Do you thrive on turning chaos into clarity and executing with precision? At Lily and Fox, we’re on a mission to make beauty more affordable and we need a Critical Operations Support Specialist to partner with our visionary CEO, Sean Barry, to make it happen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t your average assistant gig. You’re the Operations Team&#39;s foundation, a key resource who sees where help is needed, and jumps in to solve problems and make sure the everything runs smoothly. From owning daily checklists, to optimizing the warehouse, you’ll be the force that keeps everything running smoother, faster, and smarter. If you’re assertive, polished, and obsessed with getting things done, this is your chance to shine!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why This Role Rocks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the Operations Team&#39;s Secret Weapon: See inefficencies and get them fixed right away.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the daily checklists that keep everything running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create Calm in the Storm: Bring order to chaos with systems, SOPs, and a proactive mindset that anticipates needs before they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a Real Difference: Help Lily and Fox inspire customers by supporting the Operations Team&#39;s daily tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You’ll Do - Big Rocks - The Game-Changers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Floor like a Pro: Keep everything organized to support lightning fast operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master Builder: Identify missing SOPs and create them, keeping everyone aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline Daily Operations: Own checklists and standards, be the shining light that everyone looks up to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule Interviews Like a Pro: Own the Careers Inbox, post roles, and coordinate interviews to build a world class team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nail Onboarding: Make every new Team Member&#39;s first day the best day of their life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;80% Daily Wins – Keep the Machine Humming&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the Last Line of Defense: Jump in where needed to keep everything running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Operations: Maintain supplies to keep every day running perfectly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle curveballs: Solve critical operations issues as soon as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Team Coordination: Follow up on deliverables, identify bottlenecks, and keep the team aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
